				<r3d:description language="eng">The NWT Discovery Portal is the most comprehensive online source for environmental monitoring knowledge in the Northwest Territories. It is administered by the NWT Cumulative Impact Monitoring Program. The Portal is a search tool that allows users to access data, metadata and reports. It is also a share tool that allows users to contribute by uploading research and monitoring information.</r3d:description>
